g> g> <interactive>:1:15:
  |
1 | mk %override({max-repairs = 2}, x/c) & d
  |               ^
max-repairs is not a setting of %override any more: it is an option of mk and tag, written before the path (mk --max-repairs N <path>, with N a positive number or unlimited), since it limits the walks of the whole path; remove the setting max-repairs = 2 at line 1, columns 15-29. (InvalidOverrideSetting)

g> g> g> g> g> Goodbye!
